1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Foi pagem da Rainha D. Leonor
2 CONT
2 CONT * André de França, filho 1.º de João de França, foi preso por matar injustamente sua / mulher, e fugindo d'o limoeiro, foi degolado em estatua
2 CONT
2 CONT * André de França was emprisonned for murdering unjustly his wife. He managed to escape from prison.  Later his statue was thown to the fire.
2 CONT
2 CONT This kind of punishment was applied when the accused either escaped or died in captivity, so that the spectacularity of a public execution was in danger. In that case they would build a puppet which would look like the accused, an
2 CONC d perform the punishment on him. Dr. Melo , director of ARM -  (Madeira Archive) told me that the Inquisition were so scrupulous that they actually recorded the costs of the paper, paintings, etc. used to build the 'statue'.1 _UID
2 CONC  5625B4E8F526D540B95887C1BA5139C2A609
