1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Gaspar do Monte  was born in São Sebastião, Ginetes, São Miguel, Açores.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gaspar married Margarida Oliveira on 13 May 1585 in São Sebastião, Ginetes, São Miguel, Açores.
2 CONT
2 CONT The child from this marriage was:
2 CONT
2 CONT 5	i.	Apolonia Ferreira.  Apolonia married Manuel Arruda.
2 CONT
2 CONT 11.  Margarida Oliveira , daughter of Manuel Lopes and Maria de Oliveira, was born about 1555 in Candelaria, São Miguel, Açores. Another name for Margarida was Margarida Ferreira.
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: She was also called Margarida Ferreira according to the second marriage, on page 5 of the 1585 marriage book as declares the witnesess Francisco Afonso de Chaves.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source
2 CONT CAPÍTULO 166.º DA DESCENDÊNCIA DE JOÃO LOPES, DOS MOSTEIROS
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 5 of the 1585
2 CONT
2 CONT Margarida married João Almeida on 8 Jun 1570 in Candelaria, São Miguel, Açores.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margarida next married Gaspar do Monte on 13 May 1585 in São Sebastião, Ginetes, São Miguel, Açores.
