2 NICK Margarita
1 NAME Margarida Cabral de Melo
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1570
2 PLAC Santa Maria Island
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vila Do Porto
3 STAE Açores
3 POST 9580
3 CTRY Portugal
