1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Manuel Arruda  was born in Sã o Jose, Ponta Delgada, Sã o Miguel, Aç ores.
2 CONT
2 CONT Manuel married Apolonia Ferreira.
2 CONT
2 CONT The child from this marriage was:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2i.Joã o de Arruda.  Joã o married Maria de Matos.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.  Apolonia Ferreira , daughter of Gaspar do Monte and Margarida Oliveira, was born in Sã o Sebastiã o, Ginetes, Sã o Miguel, Aç ores and was christened on 16 Apr 1600 in Sã o Sebastiã o, Ginetes, Sã o Miguel, Aç ores.
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes: Apolonia Ferreira (§  11. (2), baptized in Ginetes on the 16 April 1600 being their godparents Marcos Vieira and Maria Fernandes daughter of Bartholomeu de Oliveira. Apolonia Ferreira in their affiliation enabling 3
2 CONC  of Feb.1766 fifth granddaughters, daughters of Manuel Furtado and Barbara of Conceiç ã o. She Married Manuel Arruda.
2 CONT
2 CONT
